    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112306" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρεώρῠχ-ος</span></b>  (parox.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>for digging
